{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_DD38EEB1","title":"Ask Marius for the recipe","entry":"Dlg_DD38EEB1::entry","exit":"Dlg_DD38EEB1::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_AEB7BEDD","articyId":"72057752951746786","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"Did he find my leg?","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Did he find my leg?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1050.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19036","byteOffset":15087976,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_720FF570","articyId":"72057752951746800","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"What?! Really? He's interested in the slop I make? Why would that be?","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What?! Really? He's interested in the slop I make? Why would that be?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":1650.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47485","byteOffset":32300760,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_54BE6985","articyId":"72057752951746847","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"Sorry? Sorry? This is the greatest day of my life! The idea that Aengus Prince wants one of my recipes is the greatest honor!","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sorry? Sorry? This is the greatest day of my life! The idea that Aengus Prince wants one of my recipes is the greatest honor!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2850.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30213","byteOffset":19310088,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_60EEF8C4","articyId":"72057752951746883","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"Absolutely not! The only secret ingredient is HuffHuff.","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Absolutely not! The only secret ingredient is HuffHuff.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4050.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46584","byteOffset":31955976,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_A74D3D7F","articyId":"72057752951746911","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"For the love of god though make sure you get it when it's black. If it's blue it's bad for the gut. Black is good, blue is poo! Hurry, while he's still interested!","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"For the love of god though make sure you get it when it's black. If it's blue it's bad for the gut. Black is good, blue is poo! Hurry, while he's still interested!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":5250.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37042","byteOffset":28355704,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_C6BFB8B6","articyId":"72057752951746772","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"I didn't think I'd see you again.","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I didn't think I'd see you again.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":450.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32258","byteOffset":20083408,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_D66A03BC","articyId":"72057752951746778","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Aengus sent me.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Aengus sent me.","TextSheVersion":"Aengus sent me.","TextTheyVersion":"Aengus sent me."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":750.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25210","byteOffset":17420024,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_A9F29E38","articyId":"72057752951746793","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sadly not. He was interested in your brisket Glaze actually.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sadly not. He was interested in your brisket Glaze actually.","TextSheVersion":"Sadly not. He was interested in your brisket Glaze actually.","TextTheyVersion":"Sadly not. He was interested in your brisket Glaze actually."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29980","byteOffset":19221664,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_F217F9D4","articyId":"72057752951746807","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"(Lie) He just wanted to make sure he didn't step on your toes if he worked on his own version.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"(Lie) He just wanted to make sure he didn't step on your toes if he worked on his own version.","TextSheVersion":"(Lie) He just wanted to make sure he didn't step on your toes if he worked on his own version.","TextTheyVersion":"(Lie) He just wanted to make sure he didn't step on your toes if he worked on his own version."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1950.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25279","byteOffset":17446384,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_2AAB7175","articyId":"72057752951746814","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I think he's worried about you taking his business and wants to know the secret ingredient.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think he's worried about you taking his business and wants to know the secret ingredient.","TextSheVersion":"I think he's worried about you taking his business and wants to know the secret ingredient.","TextTheyVersion":"I think he's worried about you taking his business and wants to know the secret ingredient."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1950.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43264","byteOffset":30695984,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_55AA1033","articyId":"72057752951746826","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"Are you joking me?","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Are you joking me?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2250.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27061","byteOffset":18116936,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_339A5A3B","articyId":"72057752951746833","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"Oh, he doesn't have to worry about that. I'll never be able to take customers from Aengus Prince!","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, he doesn't have to worry about that. I'll never be able to take customers from Aengus Prince!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2550.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24091","byteOffset":16993480,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_835E255D","articyId":"72057752951746840","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm really sorry.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm really sorry.","TextSheVersion":"I'm really sorry.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm really sorry."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2550.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29887","byteOffset":19187640,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_3D9A41AB","articyId":"72057752951746854","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I think he's worried. He really is willing to trade a lot for this recipe.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think he's worried. He really is willing to trade a lot for this recipe.","TextSheVersion":"I think he's worried. He really is willing to trade a lot for this recipe.","TextTheyVersion":"I think he's worried. He really is willing to trade a lot for this recipe."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2850.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26592","byteOffset":17940384,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_D374DB95","articyId":"72057752951746861","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"This could be really bad for your business.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This could be really bad for your business.","TextSheVersion":"This could be really bad for your business.","TextTheyVersion":"This could be really bad for your business."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3150.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20506","byteOffset":15640168,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_1A2CA4BF","articyId":"72057752951746868","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"I'll hear no more about it! I will personally deliver the recipe myself... No Marius, play it cool. Play it ice cold. I should send it with you. He'll respect that more.","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'll hear no more about it! I will personally deliver the recipe myself... No Marius, play it cool. Play it ice cold. I should send it with you. He'll respect that more.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3450.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36313","byteOffset":28083192,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_2C3551DB","articyId":"72057752951746876","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Ok... is it complicated?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ok... is it complicated?","TextSheVersion":"Ok... is it complicated?","TextTheyVersion":"Ok... is it complicated?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3750.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50691","byteOffset":33517592,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_01E4FE3B","articyId":"72057752951746890","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What is HuffHuff?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What is HuffHuff?","TextSheVersion":"What is HuffHuff?","TextTheyVersion":"What is HuffHuff?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4350.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45005","byteOffset":31360128,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_2EF63F7E","articyId":"72057752951746897","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"You know that black residue that builds up on the exhaust of a Hova? That's HuffHuff, looks a little disgusting but you put it in a brisket and something magical happens.","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You know that black residue that builds up on the exhaust of a Hova? That's HuffHuff, looks a little disgusting but you put it in a brisket and something magical happens.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4650.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21776","byteOffset":16128208,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_43BD358E","articyId":"72057752951746904","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"That's it? Exhaust fumes?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's it? Exhaust fumes?","TextSheVersion":"That's it? Exhaust fumes?","TextTheyVersion":"That's it? Exhaust fumes?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4950.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21348","byteOffset":15963424,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"Ins_495E1E63","articyId":"72057752951746821","type":"action","className":"Instruction","speaker":null,"text":"","speakerId":null,"textSource":"authored","pronounText":null,"effects":[{"type":"delta","variable":"GlobalMorality.Corp","value":-1}],"conditions":[],"script":"GlobalMorality.Corp -= 1","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2250.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19788","byteOffset":15368672,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"Dlg_DD38EEB1::entry","type":"entry","text":"Ask Marius for the recipe","speaker":null,"effects":[],"conditions":[]},{"id":"Dlg_DD38EEB1::exit","type":"exit","text":"Ask Marius for the recipe","speaker":null,"effects":[],"conditions":[]},{"id":"Dlg_A9645BAB","type":"external","text":"Discuss your options with Ava","speaker":null,"effects":[],"conditions":[],"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42995","byteOffset":30595504,"byteLength":420},"dialogueId":"Dlg_A9645BAB"}],"edges":[{"id":"Dlg_DD38EEB1::entry:72057752951746768:0","from":"Dlg_DD38EEB1::entry","to":"DFr_C6BFB8B6","fromPin":"72057752951746768","toPin":"7205775295